{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Goal:</strong>\u00a0Guide <strong>Kubke</strong> in his search of <strong>6 Elemental Orbs</strong>, build the <strong>City of Elements</strong>\u00a0and face the keeper of all knowledge,\u00a0<strong>Yazik</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560170/extras/gif.gif?t=1741114267\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your own Golem:</strong> Construct a powerful Adventure Golem to explore a procedurally generated hexagonal world for you. Upgrade it to take on more powerful foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexagonal Research Puzzle Minigame:</strong>\u00a0Study and connect elemental aspects in order to conduct research. As you progress, the minigame will become more challenging, but the rewards will be better too!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management:</strong>\u00a0Divide up your golem workforce between tasks so that the City of Elements prospers even when you are not watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the world of Yagazem with its own language:</strong> Read about the lore of a fantasy world. Learn how to pronounce the word using a built-in orthography chart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560170/extras/gif2.gif?t=1741114267\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560170?t=1741114267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560170/76a44c4ba10625d0c0143edad9c2429c0350352e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741114267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560170/eb5860cd7424c3046c7b0cfbc0b6b04966900db1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741114267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati